# Deny by default, then re-include exactly what ships. The previous version
# listed things to exclude and shipped `.gitignore` inside the .vsix as a
# result — an allowlist cannot leak a file nobody thought to name.
**

!package.json
!README.md
!dist/extension.js

# Never, even if a rule above is later loosened. Test doubles and the auth
# stubs must not reach a published artifact.
tests/**
src/**
dist-test/**
**/*.map
**/*.vsix
